{"ID":"20240206114052-qfxx828","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206114052-qfxx828","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114052-qfxx828\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114056-8w3pr9n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611140413-lc8ffva\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114104-hmloitv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"164通草（白通草、通脱木）","type":"doc","updated":"20240820114456"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114056-8w3pr9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114056-8w3pr9n","updated":"20240206114110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、贵州、湖北、云南等地。\n【性状】\t茎贿呈圆柱形，长2040cm，直径12.5cm。表面白色或淡黄色，有浅纵沟纹。体轻，质松软，稍有弹性，易折断，断面平坦，显银白色光泽，中内有直径0.3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5cm的空心或半透明的薄膜，纵剖面呈梯状排列，实心者 (仅在细小茎贿中的某小段) 少见。无臭，无味。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热利湿；通乳，用于淋症涩痛；小便不利；水肿；黄疸；湿温病；小便短赤；产后乳少；经闭；带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240624142908-idclhy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624142908-idclhy1","updated":"20240624142908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624142903-mvqzyzb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 494px;\" parent-style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240206114104-hmloitv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114104-hmloitv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114056-c5uq17p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240624140715-0cjs8e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624140715-0cjs8e3","updated":"20240813154825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 419px;","style":"width: 409px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"通草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/通草-20240813152845-1o8oyln.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 409px;\" parent-style=\"width: 419px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 477px;","style":"width: 467px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624142246-q980x4b.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 467px;\" parent-style=\"width: 477px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813154604-z2mrlmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813154604-z2mrlmd","updated":"20240813154645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"通草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/通草 8-20240813154604-fi0no40.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"wi